Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 11:46:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] further patch edits to fix the surface pro 7.0 quickspi
 driver and discrete driver for the intel-thc-hid driver. This patch fixes the
 issue where the quickspi driver was not properly initializing the device,
 causing it to not function correctly. The discrete driver was also updated to
 properly handle the device's power management features.

---
 .../intel-quickspi/pci-quickspi.c             | 153 ++++++++----------
 .../intel-quickspi/quickspi-protocol.c        |  10 +-
 drivers/platform/surface/surfacepro3_button.c |   2 +-
 drivers/platform/x86/intel/int3472/discrete.c |  15 +-
 4 files changed, 78 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/hid/intel-thc-hid/intel-quickspi/pci-quickspi.c b/drivers/hid/intel-thc-hid/intel-quickspi/pci-quickspi.c
index 4ae2e1718..6d2051ade 100644
